    "name": "Void Stealer Bodycam Horror",
    "steam_appid": 3162140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/c305d9e31728c4507ba0abfd2e68d298.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE DEMO AVAILABLE NOW ON STEAM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Stealer is a hardcore single player bodycam extraction shooter with experimental 144 FPS mode, horror atmosphere and survival elements in dangerous open world where the death of your character means a complete loss of progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the terrifying Cluster - an abandoned restricted area devastated by a mysterious Delta radiation, whose secrets are guarded by hostile military forces and extraterrestrial entities. On this trip you will not be limited only to the familiar landscapes of your homeworld - go beyond the threshold of our planet, into the unchartered Dimensions of the Void, find the precious Quasar and successfully leave the Cluster. Be aware your next visits can be different - a random selection of alternative pre-designed game world elements will diversify your adventure in the most unexpected places (randomization works at the first loading of each play session). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/733a9975bbbda56f4a39a56bbf77aec9.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/2752e9f60d2c536f6a0f361c5f4bed07.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photorealistic textures of the environment, advanced volumetric dynamic lighting with real-time shadows from multiple light sources and detailed simulation of various weather conditions with realistic physical behavior of particle effects create an image of incredible beauty on your screen.. Which you will see through the lens of a bodycam! Not just a cheap and boring fish eye effect like many other games, but a complex and comfortable bodycam controller, specially developed for this game, which greatly fits intense combats and even 3D-platforming. A vision created not just by an artist, but also by a professional certified optician, embodied using the best and proven graphic technologies and realistic camera animations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/2ba519d85753d3c73b52bcdfed179c58.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/2bb9ffabc575a55d03d90b9be260fc38.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for dripping springs of clean water and crackling bonfires for cooking. Track wild animals by their footsteps and avoid unwanted enemies. High-quality audio with dozens of independent sources will become your second sight, and sometimes even replace the first one. A completely new level of survival planning in your mind. This is the game where powerful sound card and advanced gaming headphones will dive you into frightening ASMR heavens like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/6f4c349612709d142b032596c5a0f5f4.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/fb46673488f27bfc1633e342529aca54.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique Screen Space Suffering system, designed specifically to enhance the atmosphere of bodycam simulation, will allow you to feel every hit, every bullet and every drop of blood you lose (you will literally spurt it onto the surrounding space when you start bleeding).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/de3f51da1d9c9c84f3b3625d82345386.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/b7a2211f3a4fa62ca28294b261f5f10f.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather precious Delta Energy by getting the Pulsars from twisted zones of harmful interdimensional radiation to power your gear's special abilities, including anti-gravitational jumps, sprint boosts, air dashes, and even slowing down the time itself! Change the rules of classic horror game and turn yourself from a fragile victim into a deadliest hunter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/2d261479e8747f267c036671bad3d1ea.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/c5516f0a5556a4cb63edc768c0fa816d.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the maddening Limirinths - ever-changing liminal spaces warped by Delta radiation that contain a myriad of dangers and a unique reward - a powerful Liminar at the heart of the Limirinth that will increase your Delta Abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/accc2f4c51a0dac270593619f7607b88.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/edd27522e55b0b9ba7eb544ff02948b5.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own bodycam trip into a large and highly detailed hostile open world created with the mix of hand-crafted locations, randomization and procedural landscape pre-generation. No persistent minimaps or magical compasses - use the position of the sun and the direction of the wind for navigating in wilderness, or pay the price in precious Delta Energy for every look at the markers of known locations with the help of Delta Scan. But not only valuable resources will be your reward for such a difficult exploring - find digital notes and investigate the blood curdling lore of a brand new universe, which designed as a unique cocktail of horror, modern urban mystics, science fiction and post-apocalypse. Each new play session will choose one of the alternative world presets where you can find a separate pieces of the terrifying multiversal knowledge. Spoiler: you are not in safe even when you read. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/136ee92bde2584c854d8b9b585beb831.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/8932c7cee15208113c0ba8f3e9756f4c.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO ray tracing, NO high-end system requirements, NO extra trash.. just a superior AAA-like graphics in native resolution with experimental 144 Frames-Per-Second mode* based on the best technologies of Unity engine. And yes, you read previous info correctly - modern game with superior graphics on Unity engine.. It is ACTUALLY REAL!** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(* Experimental 144 FPS mode is works as intended if you have a suitable 144 HZ monitor and equipment and must be manually switched from the in-game menu, but the game is also highly optimized to run at 60 FPS by default on classic monitors) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(** No shit, I swear!)</p>",
