g\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/136ee92bde2584c854d8b9b585beb831.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162140/extras/8932c7cee15208113c0ba8f3e9756f4c.avif?t=1727433294\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO ray tracing, NO high-end system requirements, NO extra trash.. just a superior AAA-like graphics in native resolution with experimental 144 Frames-Per-Second mode* based on the best technologies of Unity engine. And yes, you read previous info correctly - modern game with superior graphics on Unity engine.. It is ACTUALLY REAL!** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(* Experimental 144 FPS mode is works as intended if you have a suitable 144 HZ monitor and equipment and must be manually switched from the in-game menu, but the game is also highly optimized to run at 60 FPS by default on classic monitors) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(** No shit, I swear!)</p>",
